# Normalize line endings; indent with spaces in the working tree
* text=auto eol=lf

# Exclude files from exporting

## Graphics
*.png      export-ignore
*.jpg      export-ignore
*.jpeg     export-ignore
*.gif      export-ignore
*.tif      export-ignore
*.tiff     export-ignore
*.ico      export-ignore
*.svg      export-ignore
*.eps      export-ignore